    "body": "After a series of attempts, I finally succeeded in submitting the HTTP tracker, but I used a new subdomain:\nipv4:\n```\nhttp://4.tracker.devnak.win:6969/announce\n```\nipv6:\n```\nhttp://6.tracker.devnak.win:6969/announce\n````\nalso available with udp:\n```\nudp://4.tracker.devnak.win:6969/announce\nudp://6.tracker.devnak.win:6969/announce\n```\n\nCan the old domain(`bt-tracker.devnak.win`and`ipv6.bt-tracker.devnak.win`) help me get removed from the newTrackon list?\nThanks.",
