    "body": "@MaDTiA  check https://newtrackon.com/faq\n\n> **I am trying to submit new trackers to the list but they are not added**\nVerify that the tracker is not already in the list. This includes URL and IP(s); if a tracker resolves to the same IP(s) than any tracker already in the list, that counts as duplicate.\nCheck that the tracker is currently working with your BitTorrent client. Only trackers working when submitted are added to the list.\nVerify your tracker does not deny connections according to the [BEP34](https://www.bittorrent.org/beps/bep_0034.html).\nIf you have checked everything and really think there is an error with newTrackon, please [open a new GitHub issue](https://github.com/CorralPeltzer/newTrackon/issues) or contact me as stated in the [About](https://newtrackon.com/about) section.\n\n> **I am the maintainer of a tracker and I want to change/delete the URL in the list**\nYou can use [BEP34](https://www.bittorrent.org/beps/bep_0034.html) to delete your tracker from newTrackon, or change the port and protocol. For other changes, contact me as stated in the [About](https://newtrackon.com/about) section",
